### `mobile_app/test/state/muscle_tamagotchi_state_test.dart` (14 tests)
Covers baseline `0.5`, initial-mass clamping, growth (targeted-only, delta
math, `1.0` clamp, notify), decay (reduction, time scaling, `0.0` clamp,
